tic capability when  equipped with a telescopic sight it may  be used as a sniper weapon the 90  millimeter recoilless rifle replaces the  3.5 rocket launcher as an anti-tank  weapon upon impact the round burns its  way through the tank hull and the molten  metal then ricochets killing the crew it  can be fired from the monopod or from  the shoulder the 10 6 millimeter  recoilless rifle is the company's  long-range anti-tank weapon the 81  millimeter mortar is a widely used  weapon and is normally placed in support  of the rifle company  for spectators and recruits alike a good  show  you
 

